Z||000000||engine18||12-31-1999||01:34 PM||||I have a 84 2m4 manual and my vehicle continue to run rich... I have change the oxygen sensor, and it continue to get the same code... It does have a rich scent from the exhaust. I'm afraid of causing a early death of my converter with my emission system running so rich now... Thanks for any help!!!<p>[This message has been edited by engine18 (edited 12-31-1999).]||||reg||8
